  "NARateTitle": "Data missing rate",
  "Division number Hover AgP": "Enter the number of distributions (Number of Divisions) to display. Please enter an integer (1 ≦ int ≦ 1000)",
  "Window length Hover": "ဗလာ1つの分布を計算する際の時間の幅を入力します。0.1以上、20,000(=833日)以下の数値を入力してください。間隔と等しい場合は、すべてのデータを重なりなく評価し、間隔より大きい値の場合はデータの重なりがなくなり一部のデータは評価されなくなります。間隔より小さい場合はデータの重なりが発生します。\ne.g.) 1 week = 168, 30 days = 720, a half year = 4320, one year = 8760",
  "Window length Hover AgP": "Enter the time width for calculating one plot or summary result. Please enter a number between 0.01 (=36 seconds) and less than 20,000 (=833 days). If it is equal to the interval, evaluate all data without overlap (recommended setting). If it is larger than the interval, data overlap will occur (effective when there is little data. However, since some of the same data is evaluated, there is a concern that changes may become slow). If the value is smaller than the interval, data will not overlap and some data will not be evaluated (effective when there is a large number of data. However, not recommended as some data will not be evaluated). \ne.g.) 1 week = 168h, 30 days = 720h, a half year = 4320h, one year = 8760h",
  "Window length Hover ScP": "ဗလာ1つのグラフの時間の幅を入力します。0.1以上、20,000(=833日)以下の数値を入力してください。\ne.g.) 1週間 = 168, 30日 = 720, 半年 = 4320, 1年 = 8760",
  "Division number Hover ScP": "ဗလာ表示するグラフ数(分割数)を入力します。1以上7もしくは49以下の整数を入力してください。\nFacet無効時：1以上49以下\nFacet有効時：1以上7以下",
  "Interval Hover": "ဗလာプロットを日時ごとに表示する際の日時の間隔を入力します。絶対値が0.1以上、720(=30日)以下の数値を入力してください。マイナスの値を入力すると、過去にさかのぼる方向に期間を設定できます。\ne.g.) 1 week = 168, 30 days = 720, a half year = 4320, one year = 8760",
  "Interval Hover AgP": "Enter the date and time interval when displaying plot or summary results by date and time. Please enter a number with an absolute value of 0.01 (36 seconds) or more and 720 (=30 days) or less. You can set the period backwards by entering a negative value. \ne.g.) 1 week = 168h, 30 days = 720h, a half year = 4320h, one year = 8760h",
  "Interval Hover ScP": "Enter the date and time interval when displaying the graph by date and time. Please enter a number with an absolute value of 0.01 (36 seconds) or more and 720 (=30 days) or less. You can set the period backwards by entering a negative value. \ne.g.) 1 week = 168h, 30 days = 720h, a half year = 4320h, one year = 8760h",
  "Divide by category hover msg AgP RLP": "The variables selected for the Div are used on the horizontal axis, and are aggregated or aggregated by type of variable content.",
